  "content": "[Theme 1]\n[Bb]Kimba\n[Eb]Kimba\n[Bb]Kimba\n[F7]Kimba\n\n[Theme 2]\n[Bb]Who lives down in [Eb]deepest darkest\n[Bb]Africa? [F]\n[Bb]Who's the one who [Eb]brought the jungle\n[Bb]fame?\n[Eb]Who's the king of [Gb]Animals in\n[Gm]Africa?\n[C]Kimba the white lion is his\n[F7]name!\n\n[Theme 3]\n[Bb]When we get in [Eb]trouble and we're\n[Bb]in a fight [F]\n[Bb]Who's the one who [Eb]just won't turn and\n[Bb]run?\n[Eb]Who believes in [Gb]doing good and\n[Gm]doing right?\n[C]Kimba the white lion is the\n[F7]one!\n\n[Theme 4]\n[Bb]He's the greatest [Eb]leader, there's no\n[Bb]doubt of it. [F]\n[Bb]He's the one we [Eb]count on night and\n[Bb]day.\n[Eb]When there's danger [Gb]he can get us\n[Gm]out of it\n[C]Kimba the white [F]lion leads the\n[Bb]way! [F][Bb]",
